{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of pirates, a legion of traitors, and an armada of cultists want you dead.\u00a0Craft a variety of defensive structures and upgrade your base to hold off waves of enemies. Race the clock between each attack to recover and raid the enemy back before they come again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/122c1e0b43eec7d98aeceb48949a4016.poster.avif?t=1771718337\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/122c1e0b43eec7d98aeceb48949a4016.webm?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/122c1e0b43eec7d98aeceb48949a4016.mp4?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>RAID A FALLEN EMPIRE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region of the empire has unique challenges, quests, and loot. Collect as much as you can and extract without dying to build your arsenal. No raid into a region is the same as the enemy adapts to each successful extraction you pull off. Countless combinations of weapons and abilities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/bd83150954cbb2c437c9e9e233009983.poster.avif?t=1771718337\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/bd83150954cbb2c437c9e9e233009983.webm?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/bd83150954cbb2c437c9e9e233009983.mp4?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ENTER THE VEIL</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a gateway into a corrupted realm that is spewing abominations into our dimension. Delve deep, defeat the terrors within, uncover its secrets, and end this apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/b9398143c40997158ce9f3a8e29f5efb.poster.avif?t=1771718337\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/b9398143c40997158ce9f3a8e29f5efb.webm?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/b9398143c40997158ce9f3a8e29f5efb.mp4?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/82f95879f0c06490ad03702269262cb1.poster.avif?t=1771718337\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/82f95879f0c06490ad03702269262cb1.webm?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/82f95879f0c06490ad03702269262cb1.mp4?t=1771718337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2859970?t=1771718337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2859970?t=1771718337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/df779caf8816b25b8a4bb7a78ea8aa0a0b56